  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bioinformatics &amp; Biological Resources highlight (tools and resources)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant supports further development of a repository for agriculturally important bean hybrids carrying wild alleles. These can be accessed by breeders and researchers to introduce genetic diversity into crops, in a number of countries in South America</narrative>
  </description>
